{"job_id":"F-e1b8be0c19bb46c0e824","family_id":"F-e1b8be0c19bb46c0e824","title":"국내재산 도피 방지법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001156-103962-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":11,"target_id":"616edb5ee136a4c5d2681a9721a907553b3f745cbde43b75e6a51ab281499bd4","source_hash":"961a594189be8f164a1a8b9737598767f04fb5d9d050e97012d755e8930ed589","text":"国内资产逃逸预防法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001156-103962-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":102,"target_id":"b36ba1187ee260e19555552307ffc2ab7516c23cfad6eaa26ef2c87cebfab32a","source_hash":"16722147ff95a6521088d8a8b9fc0c41f68a0c7853d013c5f1f2176fe61a7a16","text":"第一条（禁止国内资产逃逸）任何人不得为逃避国内资产的目的，将资产转移到外国或者军事分界线以北的地区，或者从事导致这种转移的任何行为。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001156-103962-ko","scope":"BODY","start":102,"end":232,"target_id":"e37809497e51685f4fe0186641c5976f9761231c2da97d477b7378eb687ec18d","source_hash":"ecaa93db8cb9c7d9f03d57b4cab2d3043aa6ce8ab61770a71ad3e2d9bc5896f6","text":"第二条（处罚） 违反第一条规定的，处十年以下有期徒刑或者一百万韩元以下罚金。但是，如果犯罪物价的三倍超过一百万韩元，则罚金不得超过该物价的三倍。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001156-103962-ko","scope":"BODY","start":232,"end":388,"target_id":"1f70a26767458464d13573438651f05bd0fd2545da32d0ed2d53c9afbc1a90f8","source_hash":"07818610117d46ec40f2b4d582df98c6d2329df814c83240b678bf30092fc0dd","text":"第三条（适用范围的排除）第一条不适用于下列任何情况。\n1. 如果获得政府授权\n2. 在财产转移或因政府需要而实施导致财产转移的行为的情况下\n3. 运输旅行或临时居住所需的日常必需品时\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001156-103962-ko","scope":"BODY","start":388,"end":569,"target_id":"2bcfbebc9557c2f3f08687d46acc94315a5410ea0b15e1b2b5c57e592b5f34f4","source_hash":"c268acccd1b676706cb3305f676fe7e40427a5f769a37269e68e539617fb2537","text":"第四条（连带责任规定）公司代表、代理人、雇员或其他工作人员在与该公司业务相关的范围内违反第一条规定的，除处罚违法者外，该公司还应承担第二条规定的罚款。但是，如果该公司在相关业务中没有疏忽尽到合理的注意和监督义务以防止此类违法行为的发生，则不适用本条规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001156-103962-ko","scope":"BODY","start":569,"end":589,"target_id":"6d1d70f548bbe241c67c176e56089f98ff96a8e5375e8457ee98a94ae511662f","source_hash":"4554ca09421ccf540b2f07e45b9cc53213d5f297b5d163ee8445693f022400b6","text":"删除文章 5 <2010.3.31>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001156-103962-ko","scope":"BODY","start":589,"end":611,"target_id":"ebc3ff91e0a3bf6068f7d995029840edfd55aa931e91fec9ac803c674fcdda20","source_hash":"ca62040b6365078643cdcbc71717f2e7baab27e1f1b00239199a4cd84bd55ce0","text":"补充规定 <第129号，1950年4月21日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001156-103962-ko","scope":"BODY","start":611,"end":633,"target_id":"e4eef6e49631b301dea642aac8d8ae50be4f5d033a78886c162f0178b73a4511","source_hash":"26436a7f2e639f51a2d46f06d0ae905ee8739688cd39970554502dcb2cf4d834","text":"第六条 本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001156-103962-ko","scope":"BODY","start":633,"end":676,"target_id":"8d8a27ed21ca82b448000baa503c86b235b90aadc5b6a8aeab670d404bc35414","source_hash":"50364d18399efa61c6165c65a11d9c8c29d43bdb682ecce6821ea57eb139edb8","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 1143，1962 年 9 月 17 日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001156-103962-ko","scope":"BODY","start":676,"end":761,"target_id":"c288ba632c0171c39facdaf40fd4a907edb679a2c26b22c82ee48cc8a2fc0293","source_hash":"30bd045b780ee749c8bd4e76ed0057c436e68002ac5c7c7647a54f11069d98d9","text":"附录（关于根据政府部门名称等变更修订建筑法等的法案）<1997年12月13日第5454号法案>\n\n本法自1998年1月1日起生效。（但书略）\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001156-103962-ko","scope":"BODY","start":761,"end":803,"target_id":"9907f665b2f44c31fdcd81b0ce573df34937bfd96eb430f535ba61d0e711fcdb","source_hash":"ba1a81fec38e0b4d91cf1f818edfbf8d7277a2bd91fb884940f57ad03f169876","text":"补充规定 <第10213号，2010年3月31日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。"},{"id":"B2-zh-00001","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":15,"target_id":"3b70cce8c5ac7c27d1e514b922200e9282ad5c99e6bcf081d838e968414cb63a","source_hash":"3e194b2eb9fcd19a71d2729c246a99b7432713448c7d2c048e8c642882e22f37","text":"《防止国内资产外逃法》实施令"},{"id":"B2-zh-00002","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":216,"target_id":"f159c805d7a1b1b5f197898df5f6e568b9aa4f9e898e668d6b83b50388146d08","source_hash":"4b36d0820f52e710a5708a8020713b429fd7abdf8bb1237afb8537abf9ecebaf","text":"第一条（境内资产的范围）根据《防止境内资产逃逸法》（以下简称“本法”）第一条规定，境内资产是指下列各项中的任何一项：\n1. 货币、辅助货币和纸币\n2. 证券或其他债券\n3. 黄金、白银、铂金或其他贵金属和宝石\n4. 外币、外币附属货币、外币纸币、外币纸币、外国证券或其他外国债券\n5. 其他动产和船舶\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00003","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":216,"end":470,"target_id":"d0bd9c91897f7472ad8bdf6f14af3bf3da7b34d46aca49f79873d7ea7eef22e1","source_hash":"37971e4a71051a81ed966ace37546d8894daff1bd49f6f21544881feaa119a0a","text":"第二条（财产转移许可申请）  凡欲依本法第三条第一款向政府申请许可者，应当向财政经济大臣提交申请，申请内容须载明下列各项事项。但依海关法或其他法律法规已取得主管机关许可者，则不在此限。<2025年12月30日修订>\n1. 财产所在地和搬迁地点\n2. 待搬运物品的类型和数量\n3. 财产转移目的\n4. 转移财产的方法\n5. 申请人工作经验和担保信\n6. 其他必要事项\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00004","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":470,"end":568,"target_id":"597b539c9fcd653d648b699443c340d19ac77c5415b16367bd533038ee225bfb","source_hash":"7e91398987125b243450cacfb8ffef61c86389bca54912b2b9283cc78445c056","text":"第三条（许可）财政经济大臣收到依据第二条提出的申请后，应当审查该申请，并且只有在申请目的并非依据本法第一条进行资产转移的情况下，方可批准该申请。<2025年12月30日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00005","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":568,"end":653,"target_id":"c7d8d072fc963451a13926fb0072ec0f57c2db85a6af8a980bb7d2424df80b5c","source_hash":"9c808404254b103768a1ad5afcd9219cd3d16b06686a0086037cf70de8e5eb9f","text":"第四条（财产转移程序）根据第三条取得许可的人应当向海关或者其他有关当局出示该许可，并办理财产转移的必要程序。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00006","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":653,"end":765,"target_id":"9036451f37181ea749b0927c1ac769be6b59dc23114733180aa1782de29b4c9a","source_hash":"ea7c698cd371c0964c90290f6b07dbfb8c0bca1e05cb7d81aeac9a32b207fe00","text":"第五条（检查等）财政经济大臣认为必要时，可派遣其管辖范围内的官员检查依据第二条申请的财产，或要求提交有关该财产的报告。<2025年12月30日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00007","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":765,"end":809,"target_id":"55feb17afd9f189b77376f862ffa89b59f1559c649d7aad36ffd010b483aca28","source_hash":"006a22bc642626617338314d6b708220b0e4543a659858e3f9879a40aba77e4f","text":"补充条款 <第4519号，1970年1月14日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00008","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":809,"end":849,"target_id":"a70b6310d64c3ac369c487e30ccbc272e0bb4c1ccea170442751d22549db67b4","source_hash":"f070c16dfc8fdaeb519c12bce09b89fce757a05e0a193af89b4dd87f8385b18f","text":"增编（财政经济部及其附属机构的组织结构）<1994年12月23日第14438号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00009","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":849,"end":879,"target_id":"06df4b2bce7d4a9907c5352478666fa2b633c3f685253147221d013e774edde1","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00010","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":879,"end":894,"target_id":"cadb64a3914c895cdca5290f58ae6049fe8073aabecb81674e225df441b31b12","source_hash":"119c19aa8cf5d20a95854f948299b43b564b2b8788981249c71d35dec8490177","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00011","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":894,"end":957,"target_id":"314ba9fdfc2a04e81ac3ac4e7f7aedfeaae49dc250f7b821a3d4a766eaf1cc95","source_hash":"c63cff657127d60148051b0f705374b953c64068e3b3ec5d841a5b2f9fd7776d","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<131> 已省略\n\n  <132> 《防止国内资产逃逸法》实施细则修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00012","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":957,"end":1022,"target_id":"d3705a8ec8286b00851f165dd83eb9648ef62afdadd522e5937b7bd89440f1a1","source_hash":"8fe2b07fd227441268e9381c922dcda80dd2d444da448ad0f35c66329121d2ac","text":"  在第二条、第三条和第五条的正文中，“财政部长”应改为“财政经济部长”。\n\n  <133>至<327>省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00013","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1022,"end":1062,"target_id":"3bdc3e97796da48117f3101efe87ec73cf18e02a6b706df3bfc19897e49eda46","source_hash":"7b7f840609c82b3dae868846b67b866c93d17b3119679e4e74fced3336fb6c58","text":"增编（司法部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第20674号，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00014","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1062,"end":1091,"target_id":"dea2b474296a053d3277e7c3a972226f3a1b752b3524ec99e7963f27b010fc6b","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00015","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1091,"end":1099,"target_id":"940c0fa36f40054e24e321fe6139c4d86b03dcf7c58b3621ece4100cc9ad453b","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00016","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1099,"end":1155,"target_id":"b6bdaeab7c8aa10d800eed298c0e7339b0f979a3e2da470d1f81fd53bd800408","source_hash":"60408ae5d56ffb0c4f65616175d4f94967f79df68d5905ebc6bab288f0b24707","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ②《防止国内资产逃逸法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00017","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1155,"end":1234,"target_id":"458ce5f5835a5445d6716bca923a254d38a1533621e53a5bdd086694d3a1eecc","source_hash":"955d6d0ad5cf1db28b7be911ebe866cf4889bcf3ba99aba2e1d0df28b33b8415","text":"  在第二条（不包括各款）、第三条和第五条的正文中，“财政经济大臣”应改为“战略财政大臣”。\n\n  ③ 至 ⑭ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00018","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1234,"end":1278,"target_id":"46a115e559b93595353fc1bdf2c754114e7afcec20c2add62175e5d22a31055b","source_hash":"9399a22547862966b6f643ddf3cf67a06193bc8b5b5b275507bcc5f019c6c45a","text":"补充规定 <第23161号，2011年9月29日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00019","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1278,"end":1313,"target_id":"78a3b79fc32887a83264b8be14f4b1a4e2a831383de6a7974ddea6e4efb3bfbf","source_hash":"8b59c57c3540285e8e1be02637d46f701778cc0c70bf104bbe5edfdc8d20cac6","text":"增编（财政经济部组织结构）<第35947号，2025年12月30日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00020","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1313,"end":1443,"target_id":"cecc24e003437155c5018e91315043a423c04cee6bfa9a08ae855309521a61ec","source_hash":"26b46567eb8a727d49cce07b3efcb7949c72d646d46ba8d2e60a303499a03abc","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2026年1月2日起生效。但是，根据本法令附录第六条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前颁布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00021","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1443,"end":1460,"target_id":"d2e23cbb2f25005a48406dd1632465caafb5c0d5f0e63ace9388a14aecf1f4f2","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00022","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1460,"end":1533,"target_id":"762610d841d2c501b257e72971ef8b52777091272b5d53720e5acd582411aa28","source_hash":"933315aa0d9a9c69efcfb5a868e8fe59ed84f21a5849491f8f4ef57a365cba8f","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<102>款省略\n\n  《防止国内资产外逃法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00023","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-002711-280983-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1533,"end":1616,"target_id":"76451f7be08d4d7ba0440bd8b240af335f0320607be31386b1ea892fb8b550c5","source_hash":"e0cb4ee87a3bb9981702ab400b6b1ad5a082aa7f2be5598cf4df2d56ec0bf66f","text":"  在第二条（不包括各款）、第三条和第五条的正文中，“战略和财政部长”应改为“财政和经济部长”。\n\n  <104> 至 <313> 已省略"}]}